.4 Cross-Attention Receiver","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/main_jax.py","source_location":"555:611","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Optional cross_attn_enabled from phase9_canvas config; Q=self+carry, KV=neighbor signals → single Other token."},{"id":"jax_sim_main_jax_orbax_checkpoint","label":"Orbax Checkpoint Resume","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/main_jax.py","source_location":"472:721","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Saves b_params/r_params only; graft_missing_param_subtrees for schema evolution; population always starts fresh on restore."},{"id":"jax_sim_network_jax_transformer_brain","label":"Flax Transformer Agent Brain","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/network_jax.py","source_location":"1:12","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Tokenized obs (own, nb_signals, local_symbols, env, own_signal, memory, culture) → embed → transformer blocks → multi-head outputs."},{"id":"jax_sim_network_jax_vq_bottleneck","label":"VQ Signal Bottleneck (STE)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/network_jax.py","source_location":"36:84","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Continuous z_e quantized to codebook; straight-through estimator; dead_code_reset replaces unused codes with batch z_e vectors."},{"id":"jax_sim_network_jax_carry_fusion","label":"Carry Fusion (Recurrent State)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/network_jax.py","source_location":"254:266","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Carry added as global bias to all tokens; new_carry = 0.9*old + 0.1*pooled; PPO uses exact historical carries from rollout."},{"id":"jax_sim_network_jax_auxiliary_heads","label":"Auxiliary Prediction Heads","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/network_jax.py","source_location":"169:343","