ed value loss; entropy bonus; optional VQ loss from rollout; alive mask for dead agents."},{"id":"jax_sim_rl_jax_auxiliary_update","label":"Auxiliary Update (Fwd + Carry + Self-Pred)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/rl_jax.py","source_location":"378:451","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Pairs t→t+1 transitions; targets loc_env from obs[t+1] and carry[t+1] with stop_gradient; self_pred cross-entropy on action[t+1]."},{"id":"jax_sim_train_entry_hot_reload","label":"Hot Module Reload (train_entry)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/train_entry.py","source_location":"16:62","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Evicts cached jax_sim.* and communication.* from sys.modules before import; asserts observations_jax and SignalCorpusWriter are current."},{"id":"jax_sim_observations_jax_red_sense_api","label":"Red Sense API v2","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/observations_jax.py","source_location":"11:38","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Per-agent Chebyshev distance to nearest live red; zeros loc_env red channel when beyond effective detection radius; shelter doubles det_r."},{"id":"jax_sim_observations_jax_limit_red_sensing","label":"Blue Limited Red Sensing","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/observations_jax.py","source_location":"102:106","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Blues call build_observations_jax with limit_red_sensing=True; reds get full red_map visibility."},{"id":"jax_sim_grid_jax_ecology","label":"Grid Ecology Layers","file_type":"concept","source_file":"jax_sim/grid_jax.py","source_location":"17:71","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Immutable GridState pytree: symbols, walls, resources, shelter, contested, scent, cultural fast/slow, puzzle layers."},{"id":"jax_sim_grid_jax_sh